  "summary": "Lying on the long box with the head off the end and the straps in the hands, chest and legs lift together into a V and roll back down.",
  "steps": [
    "Long box lengthways over the shoulder rests. Lie on the back, head just off the end, legs long, a short loop in each hand with arms hanging by the sides.",
    "Breathe out to lift the chest and legs at the same time, arms sweeping forward into a V.",
    "Breathe in to roll down bone by bone as the legs lower."
